          <text id="/data/results_group/res_impetigo_action:label">
            <value>Timoun nan ka gen Enpetigo oswa Folikulit.\n\nPwosedi:\n- Netwaye blesi ak antiseptik\n- Drene pi si li fluktue\n- Kòmanse siwo cloxacillin (125mg/5ml) si gwosè &gt;4cm oswa mak wouj oswa glann sansib oswa plizyè absè pandan 5 jou (50mg/kg chak 6 èdtan)\n- Voye l nan sant sante IJANS si timoun nan gen lafyèv epi/oswa si enfeksyon an gaye nan misk la\n- Aplike krèm antibyotik - odè trip antibyotik</value>
          </text>
          <text id="/data/results_group/res_ring_worm:label">
